{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/steam2.png?t=1744496873\" /><br><br>Ten years ago, the world almost ended. Locked away in your bunker, you were safe. The rest of the world wasn't so lucky. In a single night, monsters appeared from nowhere and ravaged the world, leaving on destruction and scattered groups of humans clinging to survival.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/makefriends.png?t=1744496873\" /><br><br>Now it's time to leave your bunker and start to rebuild. First you'll need to establish a safe space where people can be protected from the monsters that still roam the surface. That'll require resources and of course, people. The world is very different from the one you knew when you entered the bunker. People are scarce and many are prone to violence. Others just want to survive and are very appreciative of anyone that can help them do that.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/steam7.gif?t=1744496873\" /><br><br>In a world where there aren't many good people left, it turns out being one of those good ones is extremely rewarding. Build up trust and relationships with people both inside and outside of your settlement. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/Steam3.png?t=1744496873\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/scavenge.png?t=1744496873\" /><br><br>Visit multiple unique locations and scavenge resources while navigating the random events. Gather enough to build up your base and claw back some of the creature comforts you once knew.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/Steam4.png?t=1744496873\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/facedanger.png?t=1744496873\" /><br><br>Be careful where you go, monsters still roam the Earth. Moving in the daytime is your best bet as the monsters enjoy the darkness.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418120/extras/Steam6.png?t=1744496873\" /><br><br>Specifically designed for one handed play, this is a point and click style interactive visual novel.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"That's got to hurt!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/606e81a8839a867bfab3dd594058383a1d8e8290.jpg"},{"name":"Lonely Girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/ad308138a76323701f457031106d9e68ae85e7bb.jpg"},{"name":"Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/1781d02200dd855056cb3082974d677830e25ed2.jpg"},{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/6821c8ff836be7bf39499af6c972994a54ce5af9.jpg"},{"name":"Syn's Chosen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/32912044aaa9a7ffe9436a473ba1786f9a8a8ecc.jpg"},{"name":"Slaughterer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/8274d913fe389272c79cb4a9097d5cdbe26f3dc7.jpg"},{"name":"Trader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/354ccb9efb8ceba93ccbe7ab66012f9de29d45f2.jpg"},{"name":"Librarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/d96b9bda1fd03727ee920d4955b61e0b6b976219.jpg"},{"name":"I can go all night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2418120/2e55f373be35dec18f8b73ee9cf7819bec47db88.jpg"},{"